#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of librsvg"
msgstr "Instalação do librsvg"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>librsvg</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>librsvg</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:105
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --enable-vala    \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/librsvg-&librsvg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr   \\\n"
"            --enable-vala    \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/librsvg-&librsvg-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#.  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/librsvg/-/issues/1085
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>LC_ALL=C make -k check</command>.  One "
"test named <literal>bugs_bug749415_svg</literal> is known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>LC_ALL=C make -k check</command>."
" Um teste chamado <literal>bugs_bug749415_svg</literal> é conhecido por "
"falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make DOC_INSTALL_DIR='$(docdir)' install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make DOC_INSTALL_DIR='$(docdir)' install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed the package on to your system using a "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote> method, an important file was not installed and "
"should be copied and/or generated. Generate it using the following command "
"as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o pacote em seu sistema usando um método "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote>, [então] um arquivo importante não foi instalado e "
"deveria ser copiado e(ou) gerado. Gere-o usando o seguinte comando como o(a)"
" usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>gdk-pixbuf-query-loaders --update-cache</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>gdk-pixbuf-query-loaders --update-cache</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-vala</parameter>: This switch enables building of the "
"Vala bindings. Remove this switch if you don't have <xref linkend=\"vala\"/>"
" installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-vala</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a construção das "
"ligações \"Vala\". Remova essa chave se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"vala\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>DOC_INSTALL_DIR='$(docdir)'</parameter>: This override ensures "
"installing the API documentation into the expected location if <xref "
"linkend='gi-docgen'/> is installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>DOC_INSTALL_DIR='$(docdir)'</parameter>: Essa substituição "
"garante instalar a documentação da API no local esperado se <xref "
"linkend='gi-docgen'/> estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-introspection</option>: Use this switch if you have not "
"installed <application>Gobject Introspection</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-introspection</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver "
"instalado <application>Gobject Introspection</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/librsvg.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-gtk-doc</option>: This switch prevents building the API "
"documentation, even if <xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (despite the name of "
"the option) is available."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-gtk-doc</option>: Essa chave evita construir a "
"documentação da API, mesmo se <xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (apesar do nome "
"da opção) estiver disponível."

